   "en": "§ The baraita teaches: The owner of the meal-offering «puts its oil and frankincense on it.» The Gemara cites the source of this halakha: «As it is stated:» “And when anyone brings a meal-offering unto the Lord, his offering shall be of fine flour; «and he shall pour oil upon it, and put frankincense thereon”» (Leviticus 2:1)."
